      389.53,
      539.97,
      461.32
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 2 of the Special Commodity Levy Act, No. 48 of 2007, I, RaviKarunanayake, Minister of Finance of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, do by this order impose in respectof the commodity items specified in Column I of the Schedule hereto a Special Commodity Levy, at the rates specified inthe corresponding entries in Column II of that Schedule. This Order shall be valid for a period of 06 months commencingfrom 21st November 2015, subject to provisions of Sub section (3) of Section 2 of the Special Commodity Levy Act,No. 48 of 2007.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
